      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7dd811b17fdd5c14cbbead10afbd8a3e788e9c58ba908b339d2f544cedaab5a2"
      ],
      "text": "Hitch is not a terminal multiplexer UI like tmux; the terminal feels like a normal shell while Hitch proxies input/output, records context, and exposes agent-friendly commands."
    },
